 man who has built a career on sweet strikes and spectacular finishes. Dong=
peng declared it had a =E2=80=9Czero-tolerance policy=E2=80=9D towards beha=
viour that offended national sentiment, while Mengniu issued a similarly st=
ern statement. Mbapp=C3=A9 subsequently apologised, admitting his comment w=
as =E2=80=9Cill-judged=E2=80=9D and saying he understood it had hurt people=
 in China and Chinese communities around the world. La Liga also distanced =
itself from the remarks, stressing they had been made in a personal capacit=
y. This attempt at meme appreciation has proved rather more expensive than =
anticipated.</p></div></td></tr>
